
---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="A Little About This Universe"
	description="A little note about the person, the thoughts, and the feelings behind this little corner of the internet."
	pubDate={new Date('November 20 2026')}
>
	<div class="about-page">

		<div class="opening">
			<span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE INTRODUCTION</span>
			<h2>
				Well, hello there.
				<br />
				<span>It's nice to have you here.</span>
			</h2>
			<p class="opening-note">
				Before you wander through these pages, perhaps you should know
				a little about the universe you're stepping into.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="divider">
			<span>♡</span>
		</div>

		<section>
			<span class="section-label">01 — THE PERSON BEHIND THE PAGES</span>
			<h3>Just someone with a lot on their mind.</h3>

			<p>
				I'm someone who finds meaning in little things. In conversations
				that last a little longer than expected, in memories that
				randomly find their way back, in songs that somehow say
				what words cannot, and in moments that might seem ordinary
				to everyone else.
			</p>

			<p>
				I have always had a lot going on inside my head. Thoughts,
				questions, observations, stories, little fragments of
				imagination, and feelings that sometimes take a while
				to find the right words.
			</p>

			<p>
				Writing became a way of giving those things somewhere
				to exist.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="highlight">
			<span class="section-label">02 — WHY THIS PLACE EXISTS</span>
			<h3>Some things deserve their own little universe.</h3>

			<p>
				This website began with a simple thought: what if all
				those words, stories, memories, and random thoughts had
				a place of their own?
			</p>

			<p>
				A place without a particular deadline, without an
				expectation, and without the need to make everything
				perfect.
			</p>

			<p>
				Just a little space where thoughts can become words,
				words can become stories, and stories can stay.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<span class="section-label">03 — WHAT YOU'LL FIND HERE</span>
			<h3>A little bit of everything.</h3>

			<div class="things-list">
				<div class="thing">
					<span class="thing-number">01</span>
					<div>
						<h4>Thoughts & Reflections</h4>
						<p>Little observations, philosophical detours, and thoughts about life.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="thing">
					<span class="thing-number">02</span>
					<div>
						<h4>Stories & Memories</h4>
						<p>Moments worth remembering and stories worth telling.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="thing">
					<span class="thing-number">03</span>
					<div>
						<h4>Letters & Words</h4>
						<p>Things that are sometimes easier to write than to say.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="thing">
					<span class="thing-number">04</span>
					<div>
						<h4>Everything In Between</h4>
						<p>Random discoveries, curiosities, dreams, and everything else.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<div class="divider">
			<span>♡</span>
		</div>

		<div class="ending">
			<span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE SOMETHING BEFORE YOU GO</span>

			<h2>
				Make yourself at home,
				<br />
				<span>Malar.</span>
			</h2>

			<p>
				There is no particular order to any of this.
				You can start anywhere, stay as long as you like,
				and return whenever you feel like it.
			</p>

			<p class="signature">
				With love, always. ♡
			</p>

			<a href="/blog" class="journal-link">
				Explore the journal <span>↗</span>
			</a>
		</div>

	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.about-page {
		max-width: 760px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2em 0 4em;
		color: #514741;
	}

	.opening {
		text-align: center;
		padding: 3em 0 4em;
	}

	.eyebrow,
	.section-label {
		font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
		font-size: 0.65rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.2em;
		color: #b17e79;
	}

	.opening h2,
	.ending h2 {
		font-family: Georgia, serif;
		font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.2;
		letter-spacing: -0.05em;
		margin: 1em 0 0.5em;
	}

	.opening h2 span,
	.ending h2 span {
		color: #b17e79;
		font-style: italic;
	}

	.opening-note {
		max-width: 470px;
		margin: 1.5em auto 0;
		color: #82766e;
		line-height: 1.9;
		font-size: 1rem;
	}

	.divider {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 1em;
		margin: 2em 0 4em;
		color: #bc8581;
	}

	.divider::before,
	.divider::after {
		content: '';
		width: 65px;
		height: 1px;
		background: #e5d5cc;
	}

	section {
		margin-bottom: 5em;
	}

	section h3 {
		font-family: Georgia, serif;
		font-weight: 400;
		font-size: 2rem;
		line-height: 1.3;
		letter-spacing: -0.035em;
		margin: 1em 0;
		color: #463c36;
	}

	section p {
		font-size: 1rem;
		line-height: 2;
		color: #766c64;
		margin: 1.2em 0;
	}

	.highlight {
		background: #f3eeea;
		padding: 3em;
		margin-left: -2em;
		margin-right: -2em;
	}

	.things-list {
		margin-top: 2em;
	}

	.thing {
		display: flex;
		gap: 2em;
		padding: 1.5em 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid #e9dfd9;
	}

	.thing-number {
		font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		color: #b17e79;
		padding-top: 0.4em;
	}

	.thing h4 {
		font-family: Georgia, serif;
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		font-weight: 400;
		margin: 0 0 0.5em;
		color: #514741;
	}

	.thing p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.ending {
		text-align: center;
		padding: 2em 0 3em;
	}

	.ending p {
		max-width: 460px;
		margin: 1.5em auto;
		color: #82766e;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		line-height: 1.9;
	}

	.ending .signature {
		font-family: Georgia, serif;
		font-style: italic;
		color: #b17e79;
		margin-top: 2em;
	}

	.journal-link {
		display: inline-flex;
		gap: 1.5em;
		align-items: center;
		margin-top: 1.5em;
		padding: 1em 1.6em;
		border: 1px solid #d9bcb4;
		color: #765650;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		transition: all 0.3s ease;
	}

	.journal-link:hover {
		background: #b17e79;
		color: white;
	}

	@media (max-width: 700px) {
		.about-page {
			padding: 1em 0.5em 3em;
		}

		.opening {
			padding: 2em 0 3em;
		}

		.highlight {
			padding: 2em 1.5em;
			margin-left: -0.5em;
			margin-right: -0.5em;
		}

		section h3 {
			font-size: 1.7rem;
		}

		.thing {
			gap: 1.2em;
		}
	}
</style>
